:theme <name> switches, and keeps it
gluon> :theme gruvppuccin-mocha
theme is gruvppuccin-mocha · name = "gruvppuccin-mocha" in ~/.config/gluon/config.toml
gluon> :theme go
theme is go · name = "go" in ~/.config/gluon/config.toml
